{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"p-进整数"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"p-进整数"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于素数 $p$, 定义 <strong>$p$-进整数环</strong> $\\mathbb{Z}_p$ 为整数环 $\\mathbb{Z}$ 关于 $p$ 生成的理想 $(p)$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"完备化(环)","text":"完备化"}},{"Plain":", 即\n$$\r\n\\mathbb{Z}_p = \\operatorname{lim}_n \\mathbb{Z}/(p^n).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>$\\mathbb{Z}_p$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"离散赋值环","text":"离散赋值环"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}